msgstr "Xfce {{ .s1 }} is the latest development release of the Xfce desktop environment. This release should not be used in a production environments. If you are uncertain about downloading this release, you should probably use the {{ .s2 }}stable release{{ .s3 }} above. {{ .s4 }}Changes in this release{{ .s5 }}."

